e canonical noncomputable support choice is one permitted source implementation. General legal/history-adaptive support-policy coverage remains a mandatory Chapter 2 obligation, along with remaining source mapping and older-stack contribution migration. Chapter 2 and the Chapters 1-16 Goal remain incomplete. This branch is stacked on OPEN draft PR #147, exact base 9f594406a8cb405fd31573bf94530d5d8569be27; its dependencies are not claimed merged or live.\r\n\r\nValidation:\r\n- Public module/canary focused builds, shared root (9082 jobs), Tests (9218 jobs), and complete harness (466 tests, 7 existing skips).\r\n- Twelve frozen public statement hashes unchanged; 47 actual named axiom checks use only the standard three axioms or none; sixteen required actual proof-value edges pass in the compiled export.\r\n- Actual four-round outputs 1,.5,1,.5,1 have regret 1, support energy 4, positive terminal residual 1/4, and exact fixed-bound RHS 1. Public canaries also exercise all comparators, genuine clipping, complete tie supports, zero-horizon structure and invalid-future prefix invariance.\r\n- Shared Book registry has twelve unique source-qualified nodes with exact frozen hashes; final site passes 935 pages / 834 modules / 10691 declarations / 236 highlights. The index-size repair preserves every decoded node and shard, reduces bytes from 1500663 to 1496536, and leaves the 1500000-byte guard unchanged.\r\n- Distinct automated blind/source/body review and final reader records, retained failed attempts and repairs, exact immutable byte bindings, and stacked-base contribution gate are in runs/online-guessing-osd-20261004. No human or external-model review is claimed.\r\n\r\nSource: arXiv:1912.13213v10, SHA256 cef4edfa97a6e063e53e9c532717c50aa156e5bc782ea49f969b3385011a1b17; Example 2.32 printed 20 / PDF 32, original guessing game printed 1-3 / PDF 13-15, tuning printed 15 / PDF 27. Source/contract headers were stabilized before tactics; native command gates and paper file/role conventions are separately recorded.\r\n","created_at":"2026-10-04T08:15:47Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T08:16:30Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"023306bbee1c5a7ddc18e7cfb13616557b8dcf49","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/148/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/148/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/issues/148/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/statuses/b1ffe6322ceef5492c3931a0e40f7e7d5fa5ff21","head":{"label":"DakeBU:codex/research-online-guessing-osd","ref":"codex/research-online-guessing-osd","sha":"b1ffe6322ceef5492c3931a0e40f7e7d5fa5ff21","user":{"login":"DakeBU","id":159223240,"node_id":"U_kgDOCX2NyA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/159223240?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakeBU","html_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakeBU/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakeBU/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakeBU/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakeBU/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakeBU/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakeBU/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakeBU/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakeBU/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakeBU/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1279742764,"node_id":"R_kgDOTEdTLA","name":"Auto-Ba